sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant Mobile
    participant API
    participant Auth
    participant Redis
    participant JWT

    Mobile->>API: POST /auth/refresh

    API->>Auth: Validate Refresh Token

    Auth->>JWT: Verify Signature

    JWT-->>Auth: Valid

    Auth->>Redis: Check Stored Token

    Redis-->>Auth: Token Found

    Auth->>JWT: Generate New Access Token

    JWT-->>Auth: Access Token

    Auth-->>API: Authentication Success

    API-->>Mobile: New Access Token